{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/584119-bone-shadow-challenges","id":584119,"title":"Bone Shadow challenges","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-07-08T20:51:51-07:00","id":584119,"title":"Bone Shadow challenges","content":"If your players were a group of Bone Shadows who wanted to ask an NPC for a traditional challenge what type of challenges would you give them? The challenge would not be geared to auspices but rather just to the tribe.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4586-vedic","name":"Vedic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-09T00:56:43-07:00","id":584363,"title":"","content":"First one to figure out some spirit's name; First one to tell which spirit will attempt to cross into the Gauntlet first; First one to bind some spirit; Spiritual riddles contests; First one to actually gain the favor of some high ranking spirit in an otherwise adversarial court.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-14T22:49:17-07:00","id":590920,"title":"","content":"Thanks, what ended up happening is a Bone Shadow got three death spirits (it was a challenge for three players) to flee to a location with a bone to retrieve. At the outdoor location there was a bear spirit acting as a guardian in front of a cave; for the urban locations there were murder spirits guarding the entrance. All three of the spirits were charged with preventing access to the location (cave or building) where the death spirits were. All three had to first track the death spirit to its location where they discovered the spirits guarding the entrance. The Elodoth negotiated and bribed his way in and to get the item; the Irraka snuck in and stole it and the Cahalith (after getting a critical failure on his attempt to find an air spirit willing to bring him to the location and getting left out in the middle of nowhere instead) convinced the bear spirit to retrieve it for him.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4586-vedic","name":"Vedic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}